WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.144
Assemble the continuing Digital Product or Delivery Artifact.

00:00:04.144 --> 00:00:13.468
Save the offer, audience evidence, format choice, usable sample, flow, ownership, trust checks, business review and test results.

00:00:13.468 --> 00:00:20.201
Include the original problem, complete revised instruction, reason, test conditions and retest comparison.

00:00:20.201 --> 00:00:23.309
Separate observation, interpretation, assumption and simulation.

00:00:23.309 --> 00:00:35.223
Keep the provider cost model distinct from the guide’s practice subtotal, and update effort assumptions if the correction changes review or support work.

00:00:35.223 --> 00:00:39.885
Show what improved and the limits of the evidence.

00:00:39.885 --> 00:00:47.136
Completion requires a usable sample, a tested delivery path and an honest next-step decision.

00:00:47.136 --> 00:00:52.834
Choose continue, revise or pause without inventing positive feedback or sales.

00:00:52.834 --> 00:01:00.604
Save the same artifact in Project Record and workbook, then carry it into Journey Five.
